o hepatitis delta virus ribozyme</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci U S A</source><volume>97</volume><fpage>6515</fpage><lpage>6520</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10823910</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi-0030149-b019"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Xayaphoummine</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Bucher</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Thalmann</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Isambert</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Prediction and statistics of pseudoknots in RNA structures using exactly clustered stochastic simulations</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci U S A</source><volume>100</volume><fpage>15310</fpage><lpage>15315</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14676318</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi-0030149-b020"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Staple</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name><name><surname>Butcher</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Pseudoknots: RNA structures with diverse functions</article-title><source>PLoS Biology</source><volume>3</volume><elocation-id>e213.</elocation-id><comment>doi:<ext-link ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.1371/journal.pbio.0030213">10.1371/journal.pbio.0030213</ext-link></comment></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi-0030149-b021"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lyngs&#x000f8;</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Pedersen</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><year>2000</year><article-title>RNA pseudoknot prediction in energy based models</article-title><source>J Comp Biol</source><volume>7</volume><fpage>409</fpage><lpage>428</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi-0030149-b022"><citation citation-ty